OL,3,GNEWSA'I spent two years looking for
OL,4,Awork before I got a job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeala Sheils spent two years applying
OL,7,Ffor jobs with little success before
OL,8,Ffinally securing work in a hotel last
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FBefore she got a job, the 20-year-old
OL,12,Ffrom Glasgow was one of growing number
OL,13,Fof young people classed as Neet,
OL,14,Fmeaning they are not in education,
OL,15,Femployment or training.
OL,17,FThe majority (57%) have effectively
OL,18,Fdropped out of the labour market
OL,19,Faltogether and are not actively seeking
OL,20,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
