OL,3,GNEWSA'I spent two years looking for
OL,4,Awork before I got a job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeala says she wanted to work but the
OL,7,Fsupport she received from the Jobcentre
OL,8,Fwas hampered by seeing a different work
OL,9,Fcoach at almost every appointment.
